Design informed by the DayZ modding community, with thanks to Terje Bruoygard (the abandoned DeathMatch mod remains the genre's best prior art) and InclementDab (DayZ Editor, whose .dze format this mod will read natively). No third-party code is included. Powered by Sentinel.
